{"entries":[{"id":"lex:A1:snow","headword":"snow","goals":["everyday","general"],"senses":[{"id":"lex:A1:snow","pos":"noun","gloss":"برف","meaning":"دانه‌های سفید و یخ‌زده‌ای که در هوای سرد از آسمان می‌افتد. غیرقابل‌شمارش است: a lot of snow.","grammar":[{"pattern":"snow (uncountable)","note":"a lot of snow"},{"pattern":"heavy snow","note":"برف سنگین"},{"pattern":"in the snow","note":"در برف"}],"examples":[{"en":"The children are playing in the snow.","fa":"بچه‌ها در برف بازی می‌کنند."},{"en":"There was a lot of snow last winter.","fa":"زمستان گذشته برف زیادی آمد."}],"collocations":["heavy snow","in the snow","a lot of snow","snow on the mountains"],"mistake":{"wrong":"There were many snows last year.","right":"There was a lot of snow last year.","why":"snow غیرقابل‌شمارش است."},"pronunciation":{"gb":"/snəʊ/","us":"/snoʊ/"},"check":[{"type":"cloze","id":"c1","text":"The mountains are white with ___.","answer":"snow","accept":[],"fa":"کوه‌ها از برف سفیدند.","why":"snow = برف."},{"type":"choice","id":"q1","prompt":"There isn't ___ snow this year.","options":[{"text":"much","ok":true,"why":"much + اسم غیرقابل‌شمارش."},{"text":"many","ok":false,"why":"many برای اسم قابل‌شمارش است."},{"text":"a","ok":false,"why":"snow غیرقابل‌شمارش است و a نمی‌گیرد."}]},{"type":"produce","id":"p1","prompt":"اینجا زمستان‌ها برف زیادی داریم.","frame":"We have a lot of ___ here in winter.","answer":"snow","accept":[],"why":"a lot of snow."}]},{"id":"lex:A1:snow#verb","pos":"verb","gloss":"برف آمدن","meaning":"باریدنِ برف. مثل rain، فاعلش it است: It's snowing = دارد برف می‌آید.","grammar":[{"pattern":"It snows.","note":"برف می‌آید."},{"pattern":"It's snowing.","note":"دارد برف می‌آید."},{"pattern":"It snowed.","note":"برف آمد."}],"examples":[{"en":"Look! It's snowing.","fa":"نگاه کن! دارد برف می‌آید."},{"en":"It often snows here in January.","fa":"اینجا در ژانویه اغلب برف می‌آید."}],"collocations":["it's snowing","it snows","start to snow","snow all night"],"mistake":{"wrong":"Snow is coming now.","right":"It's snowing now.","why":"برای «دارد برف می‌آید» می‌گوییم It's snowing."},"pronunciation":{"gb":"/snəʊ/","us":"/snoʊ/"},"check":[{"type":"cloze","id":"c1","text":"Take your coat. It's ___ outside.","answer":"snowing","accept":[],"fa":"کتت را بردار. بیرون دارد برف می‌آید.","why":"it's snowing."},{"type":"choice","id":"q1","prompt":"It ___ a lot in the mountains every winter.","options":[{"text":"snows","ok":true,"why":"حال ساده برای عادت: snows."},{"text":"snowing","ok":false,"why":"بدون is، snowing درست نیست."},{"text":"is snow","ok":false,"why":"is snow غلط است."}]},{"type":"produce","id":"h1","prompt":"دیشب برف آمد.","frame":"It ___ last night.","answer":"snowed","accept":[],"why":"گذشتهٔ snow، snowed است و با فاعل it می‌آید."}]}],"version":"0c96e2e7445a","order":675,"unit":9,"prerequisites":["lex:A1:weather","lex:A1:cold"],"released":false},{"id":"lex:A1:colour","headword":"colour","goals":["everyday","general"],"senses":[{"id":"lex:A1:colour","pos":"noun","gloss":"رنگ","meaning":"قرمز، آبی، سبز و مانند آن. What colour is it? = چه رنگی است؟ (با is، نه has). املای آمریکایی: color.","grammar":[{"pattern":"What colour is …?","note":"… چه رنگی است؟"},{"pattern":"a bright / dark colour","note":"رنگ روشن / تیره"},{"pattern":"color","note":"املای آمریکایی"}],"examples":[{"en":"What colour is your new car?","fa":"ماشین جدیدت چه رنگی است؟"},{"en":"Green is a nice colour for a bedroom.","fa":"سبز رنگ خوبی برای اتاق خواب است."}],"collocations":["favourite colour","bright colours","what colour","a dark colour"],"mistake":{"wrong":"What colour has your bag?","right":"What colour is your bag?","why":"برای رنگ از is استفاده می‌کنیم، نه has."},"pronunciation":{"gb":"/ˈkʌlə/","us":"/ˈkʌlɚ/","note":"o اول مثل «اَ»: «کالِر»."},"check":[{"type":"cloze","id":"c1","text":"What ___ are your eyes?","answer":"colour","accept":["color"],"fa":"چشم‌هایت چه رنگی است؟","why":"What colour are …?"},{"type":"choice","id":"q1","prompt":"Red is my favourite ___.","options":[{"text":